        :rulingText """If Depthshaker Titan’s first ability causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature, it doesn’t count as “crewing” that Vehicle for any ability that would trigger due to a Vehicle becoming crewed."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If Depthshaker Titan’s first ability causes a Vehicle to become an artifact creature, its base power and toughness will be set to 3/3. Crewing that Vehicle will not restore its power and toughness. Similarly, if the ability causes a permanent with station to become an artifact creature, putting an amount of charge counters on it greater than or equal to the amount required for it to become an artifact creature won’t overwrite the base power and toughness set by Depthshaker Titan’s first ability."""@en ] .

:LongRangeSensor rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  :Card ;
    :cardName "Long-Range Sensor" ;
    :manaCost "{2}{R}" ;
    :manaValue "3"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    :hasCardType :Artifact ;
    :hasRarity :Rare ;
    :hasColor :Red ;
    :hasColorIdentity :Red ;
    :isInSet :EdgeOfEternitiesCommander ;
    :cardNumber "11"^^xsd:integer ;
    :artist "Artur Treffner" ;
    :hasLanguage :English ;
    :hasKeywordAction :Discover ;
    :printedText """Whenever you attack a player, put a charge counter on this artifact.
{1}, Remove two charge counters from this artifact: Discover 4. Activate only as a sorcery. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 4 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)"""@en ;
    :oracleText """Whenever you attack a player, put a charge counter on this artifact.
{1}, Remove two charge counters from this artifact: Discover 4. Activate only as a sorcery. (Exile cards from the top of your library until you exile a nonland card with mana value 4 or less. Cast it without paying its mana cost or put it into your hand. Put the rest on the bottom in a random order.)"""@en ;
    :scryfallUrl "https://scryfall.com/card/eoc/11/long-range-sensor"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :hasLegality
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Commander ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Standard ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Modern ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Legacy ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Vintage ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pioneer ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pauper ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ;
    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If you can’t cast the discovered card (perhaps because there are no legal targets for the spell), you’ll put it into your hand."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Long-Range Sensor’s first ability will trigger once for each player you attack."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If you discover an adventurer card, split card, or modal double-faced card, you might be able to cast that card with either set of characteristics depending on the effect’s discover value. For example, if you discover 4 and reveal Galvanic Giant (an adventurer card from Wilds of Eldraine with a mana value of 4), you could cast Galvanic Giant, but not Storm Reading (its Adventure, which has a mana value of 7). If you discover 7 and reveal Galvanic Giant, you could cast either Galvanic Giant or Storm Reading."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """The mana value of a split card is determined by the combined mana cost of its two halves. If discover allows you to cast a split card, you may cast either half (as long as its mana value is less than or equal to the effect’s discover value) but not both halves."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """You exile the cards face up. All players will be able to see them."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If you cast a spell “without paying its mana cost,” you can’t choose to cast it for any alternative costs. You can, however, pay additional costs. If the spell has any mandatory additional costs, you must pay those to cast it."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """When you discover, you must exile cards. The only optional part of the ability is whether you cast the exiled card or put it into your hand."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2025-07-25"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If the discovered card has {X} in its mana cost, you must choose 0 as the value of X when casting it without paying its mana cost."""@en ] .

