        :rulingDate "2015-06-22"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If enough -1/-1 counters are put on Hangarback Walker at the same time to make its toughness 0 or less, the number of +1/+1 counters on it before it got any -1/-1 counters will be used to determine how many Thopter tokens you get. For example, if there are three +1/+1 counters on Hangarback Walker and it gets four -1/-1 counters, you'll get three Thopter tokens. That's because Hangarback Walker's triggered ability checks the creature's existence just before it leaves the battlefield, and it still has all those counters on it at that point."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2015-06-22"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """The value of each X in Hangarback Walker's mana cost must be equal. For example, if X is 2, you'll pay {4} to cast Hangarback Walker and it will enter the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it."""@en ] .

:LuxArtillery rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                  :Card ;
    :cardName "Lux Artillery" ;
    :manaCost "{4}" ;
    :manaValue "4"^^xsd:nonNegativeInteger ;
    :hasCardType :Artifact ;
    :hasRarity :Rare ;
    :isInSet :EdgeOfEternitiesCommander ;
    :cardNumber "140"^^xsd:integer ;
    :artist "Jason Kang" ;
    :hasLanguage :English ;
    :printedText """Whenever you cast an artifact creature spell, it gains sunburst. (It enters with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)
At the beginning of your end step, if there are thirty or more counters among artifacts and creatures you control, this artifact deals 10 damage to each opponent."""@en ;
    :oracleText """Whenever you cast an artifact creature spell, it gains sunburst. (It enters with a +1/+1 counter on it for each color of mana spent to cast it.)
At the beginning of your end step, if there are thirty or more counters among artifacts and creatures you control, this artifact deals 10 damage to each opponent."""@en ;
    :scryfallUrl "https://scryfall.com/card/eoc/140/lux-artillery"^^xsd:anyURI ;
    :hasLegality
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Commander ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Standard ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Modern ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Legacy ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Vintage ; :hasLegalityStatus :Legal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pioneer ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ,
      [ rdf:type :LegalityMapping ; :inFormat :Pauper ; :hasLegalityStatus :NotLegal ] ;
    :hasRuling
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2023-02-04"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """Lux Artillery's last ability will check if there are thirty or more counters among artifacts and creatures you control as your end step begins. If there aren't, the ability won't trigger at all. If there are, the ability will check again as it tries to resolve. If the number of counters among artifacts and creatures you control has fallen below thirty, the ability won't do anything."""@en ] ,
      [ rdf:type :Ruling ;
        :rulingDate "2023-02-04"^^xsd:date ;
        :rulingText """If the artifact creature already has sunburst (or if you control multiple copies of Lux Artillery), each instance of sunburst works separately."""@en ] .

