        :rulingText """The Mycosynth Gardens copies exactly what was printed on the original artifact and nothing else (unless that permanent is copying something else; see below). It doesn't copy whether that artifact is tapped or untapped, whether it has any counters on it or Auras and Equipment attached to it, and so on."""@en ] .

